<title>UK: Sherwood Group maintains yr dividend.</title>
<headline>Sherwood Group maintains yr dividend.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		 1.7		   vs   8.9</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	  2.3		   vs   2.3</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)  3.6		   vs   3.6</p>
<p> Pretax			5.0		   vs  17.2</p>
<p> Turnover		  166.1		   vs 179.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Restructuring costs for the year amounted to 3.4 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name of the garment and lace manufacturer - Sherwood Group Plc.</p>
</text>
